Title: Sample Size Estimation for Clinical Trials in Multiple Paradigms
Author: Rachel Zhuang <rachel-zhuang1@hotmail.com>, R. Oliver VandenBerg <vandenbergroliver@gmail.com>
Maintainer: R. Oliver VandenBerg <vandenbergroliver@gmail.com>
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Description: Includes Sample size estimations for one and term arm trials in standard, non-inferiority, and longitudinal cases, under both Bayesian and Frequentist paradigms. Some fiducial sample size estimation may be included later.
